
 MinoLinux - live image
   startx           start Openbox (try how responsive it is on your hardware)
   nmtui            set up the network (Wi-Fi / Ethernet)
   mino-install     install the system to disk (ERASES the selected disk)
   archinstall      alternative installer (then tune by hand, see the README)
   mino-lang        change the language (the system is English by default)

